### ConfigurationManager.Api example requests
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension, JetBrains HTTP Client, or copy into curl/Postman.
### Start the API first: cd src/ConfigurationManager.Api && func start

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7071/api
@adminKey = dev-admin-key
@itSupportKey = dev-itsupport-key
@ownerKey = dev-owner-key
@runtimeKey = dev-runtime-key

### --- Runtime API -----------------------------------------------------

### Safe/UI resolve - sensitive values are masked. Any authenticated role works.
GET {{baseUrl}}/configuration/resolve?tenantCode=acme&integrationName=EngagingNetworksSync&environmentName=Dev
X-Api-Key: {{itSupportKey}}

### Authorised runtime resolve - sensitive values are decrypted. Requires RuntimeReader or Admin.
GET {{baseUrl}}/runtime/configuration/resolve?tenantCode=acme&integrationName=EngagingNetworksSync&environmentName=Dev
X-Api-Key: {{runtimeKey}}

### Same runtime call, but with a role that is NOT permitted -> expect 403 Forbidden.
GET {{baseUrl}}/runtime/configuration/resolve?tenantCode=acme&integrationName=EngagingNetworksSync&environmentName=Dev
X-Api-Key: {{itSupportKey}}

### Resolve for the globalgiving tenant in Production - shows the Environment-layer override on EngagingNetworks.ApiBaseUrl.
GET {{baseUrl}}/configuration/resolve?tenantCode=globalgiving&integrationName=EngagingNetworksSync&environmentName=Production
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### --- Reference data (read-only) ---------------------------------------

### List tenants
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenants
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### List environments
GET {{baseUrl}}/environments
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### List integration types
GET {{baseUrl}}/integrationtypes
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### List integrations
GET {{baseUrl}}/integrations
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### List sections and subsections
GET {{baseUrl}}/sections
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### --- Configuration keys (management) -----------------------------------

### List all configuration keys
GET {{baseUrl}}/configuration/keys
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Get one configuration key by id (replace {{keyId}} with a real id from the list above)
@keyId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{baseUrl}}/configuration/keys/{{keyId}}
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Create a new configuration key (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/configuration/keys
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "keyName": "Shopify.ApiKey",
  "displayName": "Shopify API Key",
  "description": "API key used to authenticate against the Shopify Admin API.",
  "dataType": "Secret",
  "isRequired": true,
  "isSensitive": true,
  "visibilityGroup": "Admin",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Update configuration key metadata (Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/configuration/keys/{{keyId}}
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Shopify API Key (updated)",
  "description": "Updated description.",
  "isRequired": true,
  "isSensitive": true,
  "visibilityGroup": "Admin",
  "sortOrder": 1
}

### Disable a configuration key (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/configuration/keys/{{keyId}}/disable
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Re-enable a configuration key (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/configuration/keys/{{keyId}}/enable
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### --- Configuration values / overrides -----------------------------------

### List all override rows for a key (replace {{keyId}})
GET {{baseUrl}}/configuration/values?configurationKeyId={{keyId}}
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### List override rows scoped to a tenant + environment
GET {{baseUrl}}/configuration/values?tenantCode=acme&environmentName=Dev
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Create/update the Base value for a key (no tenantCode/environmentName)
POST {{baseUrl}}/configuration/values
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "configurationKeyId": "{{keyId}}",
  "value": "base-value-example",
  "isEnabled": true
}

### Create/update a Tenant + Environment override (most specific layer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/configuration/values
X-Api-Key: {{itSupportKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "configurationKeyId": "{{keyId}}",
  "tenantCode": "acme",
  "environmentName": "UAT",
  "value": "acme-uat-value",
  "isEnabled": true
}

### Replace a secret value (plain "value" is encrypted server-side and never echoed back)
POST {{baseUrl}}/configuration/values
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "configurationKeyId": "{{keyId}}",
  "tenantCode": "acme",
  "value": "brand-new-secret-value",
  "isEnabled": true
}

### Disable a specific override (replace {{valueId}} with a real ConfigurationValue id)
@valueId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{baseUrl}}/configuration/values/{{valueId}}/disable
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Re-enable a specific override
POST {{baseUrl}}/configuration/values/{{valueId}}/enable
X-Api-Key: {{adminKey}}
